{"id":"mitleid","lemma":"Mitleid","pos":"noun","rank":2044,"glosses":["pity, compassion"],"ipa":"/ˈmɪtlaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f9/De-Mitleid.ogg/De-Mitleid.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Mitleides"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich brauche dein Mitleid nicht.","en":"I don't need your pity.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755030","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Habe Mitleid mit mir.","en":"Have pity on me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/201679","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"}]},{"text":"Ich wollte kein Mitleid.","en":"I didn't want pity.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"no / not a"},null]},{"text":"Er hatte Mitleid mit uns.","en":"He felt pity for us.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte Mitleid mit dem Jungen.","en":"I felt pity for the boy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"to give birth"}]}]}